Package: com.mikey820.airpodsreconnectfix
Name: AirPodsReconnectFix
Version: 2.8.6
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: iOS 6 AirPods fix (post-AirPods-Pro-3 firmware): pre-emptive service re-assert every 18s to head off the ~45s firmware disconnect (plus burst-reconnect fallback), AND a gapless silent A2DP keep-warm stream so pausing/skipping tracks and system sounds keep routing to the AirPods (mechanism from asentientbot's ios-6-pods-hack, folded in)
Maintainer: mikey820 <mikey820@users.noreply.github.com>
Author: mikey820
Section: Tweaks
Icon: icon.png
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), firmware (>= 6.0)
